{"id": "section-body-17429", "title": "Acute Necrotizing Ulcerative Gingivitis (ANUG)", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "ORAL AND MAXILLOFACIAL CONDITIONS", "Gingival and Periodontal Conditions", "Acute Necrotizing Ulcerative Gingivitis (ANUG)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-17429", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Acute Necrotizing Ulcerative Gingivitis (ANUG)", "runs": [{"text": "Acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Necrotizing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ulcerative"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Gingivitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(ANUG)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1126"}}, {"id": "body-17430", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "It is a painful and severe form of gingivitis, characterized by rapid destruction of gingival tissue, particularly in the interdental papilla. The condition is often associated with poor oral hygiene, smoking, malnourished children, weakened immune system, and individuals with debilitated diseases such as Diabetes and HIV/AIDS.", "runs": [{"text": "It is a painful and severe form of gingivitis, characterized by rapid destruction of gingival tissue, particularly in the interdental papilla."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "condition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "often"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "poor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hygiene,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "smoking,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "malnourished"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "children,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "weakened"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "immune"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "system, and individuals with debilitated diseases such as Diabetes and HIV/AIDS."}]}, {"id": "body-17433", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"t